WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.274 --> 00:00:15.818
It was the first hot day of spring.

2
00:00:16.919 --> 00:00:19.400
Bobby was sweating as he walked to Kids Central.

3
00:00:25.142 --> 00:00:27.083
Nina and Izzie had paper fans.

4
00:00:28.143 --> 00:00:29.744
They waved them in front of each other.

5
00:00:32.064 --> 00:00:33.484
"What are we doing today?"

6
00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:35.025
Bobby asked Miss Shelly.

7
00:00:35.045 --> 00:00:38.106
"Please, can we go outside?"

8
00:00:38.126 --> 00:00:41.967
"I wouldn't keep you inside on such a hot day."

9
00:00:42.347 --> 00:00:43.567
Miss Shelly smiled.

10
00:00:43.587 --> 00:00:46.668
"Grab a water bottle, and follow me!"

11
00:00:49.209 --> 00:00:51.889
The kids followed Miss Shelly out to the soccer field.

12
00:00:51.909 --> 00:00:57.811
"Today we're going to play squirt freeze tag," she said.

13
00:00:57.831 --> 00:01:00.952
"Squirt freeze tag?"

14
00:01:01.276 --> 00:01:02.077
Izzie repeated.

15
00:01:02.097 --> 00:01:03.657
"What's that?"

16
00:01:03.677 --> 00:01:07.600
"One person will be 'it,'" Miss Shelly began.

17
00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:11.241
"Whoever is 'it' must tag everyone else.

18
00:01:12.322 --> 00:01:14.783
You tag someone by squirting them with water.

19
00:01:15.864 --> 00:01:18.045
If you are tagged, you cannot move!

20
00:01:19.046 --> 00:01:20.266
You must freeze!

21
00:01:21.727 --> 00:01:24.369
After everyone is tagged, we'll choose another 'it.'"

22
00:01:25.409 --> 00:01:26.770
Miss Shelly looked at everyone.

23
00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:30.492
"Understand?" The kids nodded.

24
00:01:31.512 --> 00:01:32.792
"Who gets to be 'it' first?"

25
00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:33.893
Ethan asked.

26
00:01:35.033 --> 00:01:36.093
Miss Shelly grinned.

27
00:01:36.113 --> 00:01:40.775
"I'm thinking of a number between one and twenty," she said.

28
00:01:40.795 --> 00:01:43.095
"Guess what number it is."

29
00:01:43.115 --> 00:01:46.436
"Eleven!" Bobby called out.

30
00:01:46.456 --> 00:01:49.377
"Six," said Jason.

31
00:01:49.397 --> 00:01:52.398
"Fifteen," guessed Izzie.

32
00:01:53.438 --> 00:01:55.038
"Nineteen," Ethan said.

33
00:01:55.058 --> 00:01:57.619
"Ten," guessed Nina.

34
00:01:57.639 --> 00:02:01.160
"It was eleven," Miss Shelly said.

35
00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:03.161
"Bobby, you're 'it!'"

36
00:02:03.181 --> 00:02:06.242
"Woo-hoo!" Bobby cheered.

37
00:02:07.023 --> 00:02:08.884
Everyone else put down their water bottles.

38
00:02:08.904 --> 00:02:11.985
"We'll start by standing in a circle.

39
00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:14.987
Bobby, you stand in the middle."

40
00:02:16.688 --> 00:02:18.549
Miss Shelly stood outside the circle.

41
00:02:23.212 --> 00:02:26.373
your mark, get set, go!"

42
00:02:27.274 --> 00:02:28.694
Miss Shelly blew her whistle.

43
00:02:29.715 --> 00:02:31.136
Bobby chased after Ethan.

44
00:02:32.108 --> 00:02:33.409
But Ethan was fast!

45
00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:36.611
Bobby decided to try to catch him later.

46
00:02:37.652 --> 00:02:39.553
He turned around and spotted Nina.

47
00:02:42.335 --> 00:02:43.556
He sprinted toward her.

48
00:02:49.219 --> 00:02:51.621
Nina squealed as she got squirted with water.

49
00:02:51.641 --> 00:02:54.663
"You have to freeze!"

50
00:02:55.203 --> 00:02:57.105
Izzie reminded her, running by.

51
00:02:58.105 --> 00:02:59.606
Now Bobby was after Izzie.

52
00:03:00.647 --> 00:03:03.277
He raised his water bottle Squirt!

53
00:03:04.297 --> 00:03:05.238
Izzie was frozen.

54
00:03:06.278 --> 00:03:07.879
Water dripped down her forehead.

55
00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:10.761
Bobby ran after Jason.

56
00:03:11.842 --> 00:03:13.623
Jason looked hot and tired.

57
00:03:13.643 --> 00:03:16.464
"Here's some water to cool you off!"

58
00:03:16.884 --> 00:03:17.725
Bobby shouted.

59
00:03:18.826 --> 00:03:20.446
He squirted his friend in the back.

60
00:03:21.627 --> 00:03:23.388
"Ha-ha! That's cold water!"

61
00:03:23.848 --> 00:03:25.750
Jason giggled and then froze.

62
00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:28.451
"Bet you can't catch me!"

63
00:03:28.851 --> 00:03:29.632
Ethan cried.

64
00:03:30.796 --> 00:03:32.418
He ran across the soccer field.

65
00:03:33.498 --> 00:03:34.800
Bobby raced after him.

66
00:03:37.102 --> 00:03:39.043
Ethan ran one way and then the other.

67
00:03:41.205 --> 00:03:43.387
Once, Bobby got close enough to squirt.

68
00:03:44.428 --> 00:03:46.169
But Ethan ducked out of the way!

69
00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:51.654
"Ahhh!" Bobby got a burst of energy.

70
00:03:52.475 --> 00:03:53.916
He ran as fast as he could.

71
00:03:55.037 --> 00:03:55.918
Ethan stumbled!

72
00:03:57.119 --> 00:04:00.857
Squirt! Water dripped down Ethan's back.

73
00:04:03.879 --> 00:04:05.180
"You're all frozen!"

74
00:04:05.521 --> 00:04:06.882
Bobby shouted happily.

75
00:04:06.902 --> 00:04:08.763
"Game over!"

76
00:04:09.203 --> 00:04:10.184
Miss Shelly called.

77
00:04:12.065 --> 00:04:13.987
Bobby was hot and breathing hard.

78
00:04:14.007 --> 00:04:15.928
"That was fun!"

79
00:04:16.388 --> 00:04:17.049
Nina said.

80
00:04:17.069 --> 00:04:19.030
"Let's play again!"

81
00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:20.771
Ethan looked at Miss Shelly.

82
00:04:20.791 --> 00:04:23.533
"Sure," Miss Shelly said.

83
00:04:23.553 --> 00:04:26.676
"Bobby, please pick our next 'it.'"

84
00:04:28.809 --> 00:04:33.994
"Okay. I'm thinking of a number between one and twenty," Bobby said.

85
00:04:34.775 --> 00:04:35.476
He smiled.

86
00:04:36.677 --> 00:04:39.100
Usually he didn't like getting caught in a game of tag.

87
00:04:40.021 --> 00:04:42.483
But it would feel great to get squirted with water now!
